		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Action</strong> - [[lookup @target.template.size activity=r4MGqEq5U9aaseBh]] ft. [[lookup @target.template.type capitalize activity=r4MGqEq5U9aaseBh]]</p><p><strong>[[/save constitution]]{Constitution Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>First Failure:</strong> The target has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn, when it repeats the save.</p></li><li><p><strong>Second Failure:</strong> The target has the &amp;Reference[Paralyzed apply=false] condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No effect.</p></li></ul>",
